}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Move the words up or down <span class=\"sena-icon sena-icon-vertical-drag\"></span> to complete each sentence. "}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le05ob09re2img07.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le05ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le05ob09re2img07.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le05ob09re2img07.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>: Hey Vanessa, you look a little tired today. Is everything alright?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Working as a manager is more stressful than I thought! That customer complaint really hurt.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>: Like a knife wound! I know all about that! I think you ought to be a bit more thick-skinned."}, {"time": "16000", "image": "engenn6le05ob09re2img08.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What do you suggest? How is it going to magically happen? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>: Well, you shouldn't take everything so seriously, for starters. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's easy for you to say! You spend all day in the kitchen, happily cooking. I have to make sure that every meal goes smoothly! It's hard work!"}, {"time": "34500", "image": "engenn6le05ob09re2img08.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>: I know you work hard, Vanessa, but you also need to lighten up a little. You should deal with customers firmly but cheerfully. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Should I tell a funny joke every time a client speaks rudely to me?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>: Haha. You shouldn't wait until they behave inappropriately. It will only escalate the problem. You've got to hone those people skills!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're one to talk! I wouldn't come near you with your knife skills!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": ""}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and The Rude Customer"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Stress-Free Work Environment"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Food for Thought > Overeating"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and provide solutions to problems in a range of social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le05ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing What is Necessary"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use modals like <span class=\"italic\">should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">must</span> or expressions like <span class=\"italic\">You have got to\u2026</span> or <span class=\"italic\">You are going to have to...</span> to express what is necessary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the following to express what is necessary:<ul><li>You had better ... </li> <li>You have got to ... </li> <li>I'm going to have to ... </li> <li>You need to ... </li><li>You ought ...</li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: You need to lighten up a little. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: That's easy for you to say. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: You'd better stop taking everything so seriously!"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adverbs of Manner"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Adverbs of Manner add more information to verbs to make them more specific. They usually come after the main verb. <br>Example: <br /><span class=\"italic\">She walked.  VS. She walked slowly.<br> How did she walk? Slowly.<br/></span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I make sure that every meal goes smoothly."}, {"type": "example", "content": " We need to handle our customers firmly but cheerfully."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ly</span> to an adjective:<br> <span class=\"italic\">Examples: quick - quickly, slow - slowly<br><br> </span>  Some adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ily</span> to adjectives ending in -y:<br><span class=\"italic\"> Example: angry - angrily<br><br></span>  The adverbs <span class=\"strong\">fast</span>, <span class=\"strong\">hard</span>, <span class=\"strong\">well</span> and <span class=\"strong\">straight</span> are exceptions. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"magical<br> serious\\t<br>\\t\\t happy\\t<br>\\t smooth\\t<br>\\t firm\\t<br>\\t cheerful<br>\\t\\t inappropriate\\t<br>\\t hard\\t\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" magically<br> seriously<br> happily<br> smoothly<br> firmly<br> cheerfully<br> inappropriately<br> hard\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We must handle the situation carefully. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He sometimes behaves inappropriately. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wound "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an injury caused by a cut "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I know all about knife wounds!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to describe a stressful situation at work."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "thick-skinned "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "insensitive to criticism or insults "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to be more thick-skinned!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "magically "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " in a magical manner "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How is it going to magically happen?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "for starters "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to begin with; first of all "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: For starters, you shouldn't take everything so seriously."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "smoothly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a smooth manner "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to make sure that every meal goes smoothly."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "firmly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a firm manner"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: You should deal with difficult customers firmly."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud06 "}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cheerfully"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a cheerful manner "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You ought to welcome our guests cheerfully."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inappropriately"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " in an inappropriate manner "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A customer behaved inappropriately yesterday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to escalate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a situation worse "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You shouldn't let a difficult situation escalate."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob09aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find information about stress in the workplace."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of the top 5 most stressful jobs, according to your research."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out why people feel stressed in each job.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about your list with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare your list with your partner's. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research information about stress at work and healthy habits at work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a list of 5 stressful jobs. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the list with my partner."}]}]}